# Real, direct fix (2026-09-11): a packaging near-miss caught before
# publishing - vsce does NOT respect .gitignore for what goes into the
# .vsix, only this file does. The first package build (before this file
# existed) bundled Debug/ (an internal diagnostic screenshot) and
# Training Corpus/ (the user's own live, personal corpus files,
# including in-progress drafts) into what would have been a PUBLIC
# extension package. Excluded here, explicitly, so this can't recur.
Debug/**
Training Corpus/**
.git/**
.gitignore
src/**
tsconfig.json
*.vsix
node_modules/**
package-lock.json
